  "headline": "Jakarta Traffic Adjustments For Guns N' Roses Concert At GBK",
  "seoTitle": "Guns N' Roses Concert Jakarta Traffic and Transport Updates",
  "metaDescription": "Jakarta authorities implement traffic diversions, extended public transport hours, and extra parking for the Guns N' Roses concert at GBK stadium today.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Jakarta authorities have implemented traffic diversions and designated 11 parking locations around the Gelora Bung Karno stadium for the concert.",
    "Public transport providers including Transjakarta and MRT have extended operational hours on select routes to assist attendees with travel.",
    "Police have conducted security sterilisation procedures at the venue while advising the general public to avoid the area due to expected congestion."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Guns N' Roses concert taking place at the Gelora Bung Karno (GBK) stadium in Jakarta on November 21, 2026, has prompted significant transport and security arrangements. Local authorities, including the Transportation Agency and Polda Metro Jaya, have organised traffic flow modifications, assigned 100 officers to the scene, and established multiple parking zones for attendees. To facilitate movement, Transjakarta has extended the operational hours of four specific routes, and the MRT has also increased service times. Security personnel, including members of the Gegana unit, performed site sterilisation at Stadion Madya GBK to ensure public safety prior to the event. Additionally, immigration authorities processed 82 visas collectively for the production team. The public has been advised by police to avoid the GBK area to reduce traffic congestion during the concert hours.",
